  "posted_text": "☀️ Environment & Climate\nPA SB 349 — Decommissioning of solar energy facilities\n\nThis act establishes a framework for the decommissioning of solar energy facilities within Pennsylvania, primarily focusing on financial security and land restoration requirements. It mandates that solar energy facility operators provide financial assurance – typically through an escrow account, bond, or certificate of deposit – to cover the costs of decommissioning. ...\n...",
